    <bpmn:process id="W_W3192" name="W3192. Property Disposition &amp; Portfolio Rationalization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic review (W3185); underperformance; redevelopment opportunity; portfolio rebalancing
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~1–5 dispositions/year
Owner: Real Estate Investment Manager
Participants: Real Estate Investment Mgr, Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate, Finance, Tax (links to VS-79), Legal, Broker, Store Ops (links to VS-59)
Source: workflow W3192 — Property Disposition &amp; Portfolio Rationalization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3192_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3192_Lane1" name="Real Estate Investment Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3192_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3192_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3192_Lane2" name="Broker">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3192_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3192_Lane3" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3192_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3192_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3192_Start5" name="Strategic review (W3185); underperformance; redevelopment opportunity; portfolio…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3192_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3192_Task6" name="Real Estate Investment Mgr/Finance prepare disposition case: holding vs selling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Real Estate Investment Mgr/Finance prepare disposition case: holding vs selling analysis (NOI trend, cap-rate movement, alternative-use value, redevelopment optionality), estimated proceeds vs carrying value, gain/loss and tax impact (CGT, links to VS-79), use of proceeds; obtain investment-committee approval (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Real Estate Investment Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3192_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3192_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3192_Task7" name="Broker/Legal market the property: marketing package, targeted buyer list…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Broker/Legal market the property: marketing package, targeted buyer list (REITs, developers, owner-operators), data room (links to VS-88), NDA, offers, negotiation; coordinate with Store Ops for vacate timing (links to VS-59 store closure) or sale-leaseback to a third-party occupant
Responsible (R): Broker / Legal
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate
Duration: 8–16 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3192_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3192_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3192_Task8" name="Execute sale: contract, due diligence support to buyer, closing and payment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute sale: contract, due diligence support to buyer, closing and payment, title transfer, tax settlement (CGT/DST/transfer tax, links to VS-79), derecognition from investment property (W3189/VS-35) and gain/loss booking (links to VS-17); update portfolio master and analytics (W3208)
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 4–8 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3192_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3192_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3192_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3192_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3192_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-520 (ensure controlled execution — Property Acquisition, Investment &amp; Portfolio Strategy (PA-97.1).) | - operational: pre-planned disposition window and valuation floor (W3189); operational: upfront tax planning (links to VS-79)
Owner: Real Estate Investment Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
